      "writtenOn": "2023-10-25T08:03:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this second loader project is a Proprietary one, used to update 512KB Chrome EC RO / RW image into MEC1727 internal SPI flash, it is part of development tool but not part of Chrome Zephyr EC firmware, second loader is executed prior to Chrome EC being run. So, MCHP applies same concept as Legacy EC (actually, derived from Windows project), but not Zephyr Device tree concept.",
